    "details": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"13\" data-end=\"340\"><strong data-start=\"13\" data-end=\"25\">QUANTEXA</strong> is a national-level 24-hour offline hackathon jointly presented by <strong data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"117\">HackHere &times; LeSuccess</strong>, bringing together students, developers, designers, researchers, fintech enthusiasts and technology innovators to build impactful solutions across <strong data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"339\">Quantum FinTech, Software for Social Welfare and emerging technologies</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"mz1otn\" data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1044\"><strong>Event Details</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1274\">\n<li data-section-id=\"q6io6o\" data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1085\"><strong data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1058\">Dates:</strong> 19th &amp; 20th September 2026</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"f4itdl\" data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1110\"><strong data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1101\">Duration:</strong> 24 Hours</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1bq2io8\" data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1154\"><strong data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1123\">Venue:</strong> SNS Innovation Hub, Coimbatore</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"5a7mz4\" data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1174\"><strong data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1166\">Mode:</strong> Offline</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1koydpb\" data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1203\"><strong data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1191\">Team Size:</strong> 1&ndash;4 Members</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"i13arv\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1243\"><strong data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1227\">Registration Fee:</strong> ₹1,000 per Team</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"8v7723\" data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1274\"><strong data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1263\">Registration:</strong> Slot-based</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-section-id=\"78vfs1\" data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"974\"><strong>Sponsors &amp; Partners</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1026\">\n<li data-section-id=\"l30i9y\" data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1004\">Elro Tech</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1udaz0d\" data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1013\">Delyon</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"lvjtg4\" data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1026\">UptoSkills</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"lvjtg4\" data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1026\">Elyon&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1346\"><strong>Key Highlights</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"950\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1ltx5y7\" data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"637\">₹30,000 Cash Prize Pool</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1a4plle\" data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"687\">Internship opportunities with partner companies</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1postzi\" data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"737\">Pre-Placement Interview and Offer opportunities</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1fhrr8i\" data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"786\">Exclusive AI Credits for eligible participants</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"r12tgg\" data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"818\">Real-world problem statements</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1e5n8sb\" data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"864\">Social-welfare and public-safety challenges</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1bylkay\" data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"901\">Industry mentorship and networking</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1erbnus\" data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"950\">Certificates, recognition and partner benefits</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"v4qgv8\" data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1367\"><strong>Hackathon Tracks</strong></p>\n<p data-section-id=\"15hjwzi\" data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1459\"><strong>Track 1: Quantum FinTech</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1591\">Develop innovative solutions combining finance, software and emerging quantum technologies to address modern financial challenges.</p>\n<p data-section-id=\"kdqvrv\" data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1649\"><strong>Track 2: Software for Social Welfare &amp; Public Safety</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1836\">Build technology-driven solutions for real-world social, civic and public-safety challenges, including selected problem statements based on challenges provided by the Police Department.</p>\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"kk8cq0\" data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2114\"><strong>Why Participate?</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2565\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1gw6kl3\" data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2158\">Build a working solution within 24 hours</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1v0rvgo\" data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2199\">Solve real-world technology challenges</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"j9vh7i\" data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2251\">Explore Quantum FinTech and emerging technologies</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"4kaes3\" data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2298\">Gain hands-on product development experience</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"wj6v6n\" data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2346\">Learn from industry mentors and professionals</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"y38md5\" data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2381\">Compete for a ₹30,000 prize pool</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1x5ktnk\" data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2434\">Access internships and pre-placement opportunities</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"3kxkij\" data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2465\">Receive exclusive AI Credits</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ujil2j\" data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2519\">Network with innovators from different institutions</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"3huzd9\" data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2565\">Showcase your skills on a national platform</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-section-id=\"8mhl9q\" data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2594\"><strong>Eligibility &amp; Team Rules</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2868\">\n<li data-section-id=\"jxztni\" data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2622\">Open to UG &amp; PG students</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"q9fntk\" data-start=\"2623\" data-end=\"2679\">Students from all academic disciplines may participate</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"14817j3\" data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2708\">Team Size: <strong data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2708\">1&ndash;4 Members</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"s2mc16\" data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2742\">Inter-college teams are allowed</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"8ucmo5\" data-start=\"2743\" data-end=\"2779\">Inter-department teams are allowed</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1l5c47v\" data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"2820\">Multidisciplinary teams are encouraged</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1hdy4s9\" data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2868\">Each participant may be part of only one team</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-section-id=\"iba7ir\" data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2890\"><strong>Hackathon Process</strong></p>\n<p data-section-id=\"28nmnn\" data-start=\"2892\" data-end=\"2934\"><strong>Phase 1 &ndash; Problem Selection &amp; Ideation</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2936\" data-end=\"3167\">\n<li data-section-id=\"hbaf6q\" data-start=\"2936\" data-end=\"3008\">Problem statements will be revealed at the beginning of the hackathon.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"hryw8o\" data-start=\"3009\" data-end=\"3043\">Teams must work on only one challenge.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"hbaxs8\" data-start=\"3044\" data-end=\"3117\">Participants will analyse the problem and plan their proposed solution.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"13jmtiy\" data-start=\"3118\" data-end=\"3167\">Mentors may guide teams during idea validation.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-section-id=\"7m2qc5\" data-start=\"3169\" data-end=\"3204\"><strong>Phase 2 &ndash; Prototype Development</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3392\">\n<li data-section-id=\"j547j0\" data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3261\">Teams will build their solution during the hackathon.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"u4yb5\" data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3331\">Mentors and industry professionals will interact with participants.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1bv5xp1\" data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3392\">Teams may undergo progress evaluations during development.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-section-id=\"1siyvlp\" data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3437\"><strong>Phase 3 &ndash; Final Submission &amp; Evaluation</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3655\">\n<li data-section-id=\"h0lnby\" data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3498\">Teams must submit their final prototype and presentation.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1qux0m8\" data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3567\">Shortlisted teams will demonstrate their solution before the jury.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1m5w6fk\" data-start=\"3568\" data-end=\"3655\">Final evaluation will be based on technical quality, innovation and practical impact.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-section-id=\"11mpkip\" data-start=\"3657\" data-end=\"3683\"><strong>Submission Requirements</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3705\">Teams should submit:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"3707\" data-end=\"3901\">\n<li data-section-id=\"eiu0dt\" data-start=\"3707\" data-end=\"3733\">Working prototype or MVP</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1tmtsjb\" data-start=\"3734\" data-end=\"3753\">Presentation deck</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"llsqbb\" data-start=\"3754\" data-end=\"3778\">Source-code repository</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1w0ubdj\" data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3801\">Solution description</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1eatlsw\" data-start=\"3802\" data-end=\"3820\">Technology stack</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"3wh66a\" data-start=\"3821\" data-end=\"3867\">Demo or deployment link, wherever applicable</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1xwl8yo\" data-start=\"3868\" data-end=\"3901\">Expected impact and scalability</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-section-id=\"1d1kr4w\" data-start=\"3903\" data-end=\"3925\"><strong>Evaluation Criteria</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"3927\" data-end=\"4134\">\n<li data-section-id=\"prlh7i\" data-start=\"3927\" data-end=\"3953\">Innovation &amp; Originality</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1qyomg9\" data-start=\"3954\" data-end=\"3980\">Technical Implementation</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1q8u4ar\" data-start=\"3981\" data-end=\"3996\">Functionality</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"qwiu1u\" data-start=\"3997\" data-end=\"4016\">Problem Relevance</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"pphwe1\" data-start=\"4017\" data-end=\"4035\">Practical Impact</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"msggfn\" data-start=\"4036\" data-end=\"4049\">Feasibility</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"kdgb1r\" data-start=\"4064\" data-end=\"4097\">Security &amp; Responsible Data Use</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"6foppt\" data-start=\"4098\" data-end=\"4134\">Final Presentation &amp; Demonstration</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1cw0fzq\" data-start=\"4735\" data-end=\"4781\"><strong>QUANTEXA &mdash; Think Quantum. Shape the Future.</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"4783\" data-end=\"4811\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"4783\" data-end=\"4811\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Learn &bull; Build &bull; Disrupt.</strong></p>",
